From ef724e807aec75b56b01a6b6ec684666a897df22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxlinear <nobody@maxlinear.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Feb 2022 10:50:53 +0100
Subject: 702-ip-map-support

iproute2: Add support for MAP-E FMRs (mesh mode) configuration with ip utility

This will enable map-e tunnel feature. The patch is taken from
http://enog.jp/~masakazu/vyatta/map/iproute-2014-03-07.patch
---
 include/linux/if_map.h |  123 +++++
 ip/Makefile            |    2 +-
 ip/ip.c                |    5 +-
 ip/ip_common.h         |    1 +
 ip/ipmap.c             | 1086 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 1214 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 include/linux/if_map.h
 create mode 100644 ip/ipmap.c

diff --git a/include/linux/if_map.h b/include/linux/if_map.h
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..83f6a49a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/include/linux/if_map.h
@@ -0,0 +1,123 @@
+/*
+ * ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * "THE BEER-WARE LICENSE" (Revision 42):
+ * <m-asama@ginzado.co.jp> wrote this file. As long as you retain this notice
